      "text": "Salute metabolica, glicemia e HbA1c",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "10f7635af427083d6757d5fde4144d6f7e9ad24bde01ac23138760331ae98d0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.reference",
      "text": "Criteri OMS/ADA per il (pre)diabete",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "d129722f1e629c24eb4cfef1ed189aab2933ba838decba9b61b97f6c80223825"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.1",
      "text": "HbA1c: normale sotto 5,7%; prediabete 5,7–6,4%; diabete a partire da 6,5%.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "e69b055710dde9d3be45a18afe3427379ecc10ad11cfe873a46318a3d7afd887"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.2",
      "text": "Glicemia a digiuno: normale sotto 5,6; prediabete 5,6–6,9; diabete a partire da 7,0 mmol/L.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "cda43d60cb3a569aaf76a2f97c78debba9fc8a6d4638fa3f317b2870ac6cfe9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.3",
      "text": "Trigliceridi: normali sotto 1,7 mmol/L (sotto 150 mg/dL).",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "a420cbb8626e67abfbaf5f7ce92325d24944baebb820acff848d1b341d52d928"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.4",
      "text": "Il prediabete può spesso regredire grazie all’attività fisica, alla gestione del peso e all’alimentazione.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "010d6734f73a7ae22130ed6541820956d591f4e1ca780309609a229c21313277"
    },
